########## SUBCONSCIOUS — ACTIVE CONCERNS (this week) ##########
*These were emitted by the subconscious noticer. They route via `addressable_by`: items addressed to `dayflow_orchestrator` are yours to act on (consider opening a plan_task or escalation ticket). Items addressed to other channels (chat_brain, *_proposer) are background context — don't double-handle them.*
{%- for c in _subc.active_concerns_this_week %}
- [{{ c.severity }}/{{ c.horizon }}] {{ c.title }}
  subject: {{ c.subject }} | addressable_by: {{ c.addressable_by | join(", ") }} | evidence: {{ c.evidence_count }}
  notes: {{ c.notes }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif %}
